    ["Encrusted Tide Crawlers drop the chunks too, but Reef Crawlers are the easier kill."] = "Encrusted Tide Crawler도 조각을 드랍하지만 Reef Crawler가 잡기 쉬워요.",
    ["Enemies here are usually level 10-22."] = "이곳 적은 보통 레벨 10-22예요.",
